      "The closed monthly volatility-target policy continuously sized BTC from lagged BTC realized volatility; this policy is binary BTC-or-cash and contains no BTC volatility estimate.",
      "The open post-shock families require a terminal forward review after a three-percent BTC event; this policy uses every available lagged Cboe close and never reads those labels."
